Z||000000||Jeff's '86 1/2 GT||07-31-2000||11:02 PM||||<BR>My interior is perfect except for the warping from the sun.  How do I fix this?  Is there a way to glue it back in place, and if so what glue do I use? ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Dan86gt3.8||07-31-2000||11:33 PM||||If you find out let me know!  The edges around my radiao/ac controlss and the are around the gt gausges has rolled out (I suspect from the texas heat!||||reg||1
